title: 'C-c v s : skg-view-linkstack'
pid: 94d34ac8-ab27-459c-9986-c59f91cafec7
body: |2-
  repeated here; described earlier in this doc.
  In the linkstack buffer, =C-x C-s= saves your edits to the stack.
  A chain shows as nested headlines, each child's title beginning
  with its edge to its parent, "(aC) "; keep that edge when editing
  one (see skg-push-ancestry).
